              "confidence": "high",
              "recommendation": "Bound the raw arguments before hashing them: in Vorpruefung.check, pre-walk the arguments and reject (or cheaply cap) nesting depth and total encoded size before Params.check and before building the refusal PDR; independently give KomkiPolicy.JSON.canonical/encode_value an explicit depth limit that fails with a structured error instead of recursing per input level. Optionally spawn the per-request anubis task with spawn_opt max_heap_size so a runaway request dies alone instead of starving the VM.",
              "cwe_id": "CWE-674",
              "snippet": "\"intent_hash\" => Hash.sha256_hex(JSON.canonical(%{\"tool\" => tool, \"params\" => args})),",
              "symbol": "KomkiMediator.Vorpruefung.refused/5",
