              "exploit_scenario": "On a shared Mac, komki runs an instance with KOMKI_HOME=/private/tmp/komki-test (the shorter base the project's own socket-length error message recommends, and the wegwerf/smoke pattern this repo practices). create_dirs builds pi-home and its .pi/agent subdirectories with default 0755, and every `komki up` writes models.json with the ambient-umask default (0644 under umask 022) holding the fresh llama key. A second local user lists /private/tmp, reads models.json, and can now run inference against 127.0.0.1:<port> — while the instance's actual tokens (mediator.token, connector tokens, hub hash) all remain correctly 0600/0700.",
