              "confidence": "medium",
              "recommendation": "Apply the same discipline already used for llama.key, the mediator token (channel.ex:79-81) and the sidecar tokens (sidecar/token.ex:31-34) in write_models/1: create the file empty, File.chmod!(path, 0o600), then write the content — and/or chmod the pi_home chain to 0700 in create_dirs, which also protects the session transcripts stored under pi-home.",
