                "Default umask (022): directory 0755, staged/template files 0644"
              ],
              "category": "Incorrect Default Permissions",
              "severity": "LOW",
              "confidence": "medium",
              "recommendation": "chmod documents_dir (and the mediator parent) to 0700 alongside run/connectors in ensure_run_dirs!, session_intake.plan and Templates.write_templates, and write staged and template documents with 0600 (File.cp already inherits source mode — force it), mirroring the treatment of sockets, tokens and the denials directory.",
              "cwe_id": "CWE-276",
