              "exploit_scenario": "A victim receives a document whose name contains '\\n  datei: vertraulich.md -> permit' or an OSC 52 sequence (valid APFS file names), and brings it into 'komki session <file>'; the intake header prints the crafted lines/sequences to the terminal, misrepresenting what is being admitted or overwriting the clipboard.",
