              "exploit_scenario": "A same-uid attacker (or compromised dependency) replaces the pinned komki-mediator file after tampering with the mediator journal. `komki up` and `komki doctor` refuse on the pin FAIL, but the user's routine `komki journal verify` executes the swapped binary, which prints a valid-looking verification result that komki renders as \"Journal ok\", laundering the tampered audit trail.",
              "preconditions": [
                "Same-uid write access to the pinned mediator path (and/or the escript runtime path) on the instance",
                "The user runs `komki journal verify` while the pins are drifted"
              ],
              "category": "Incorrect Authorization",
              "severity": "LOW",
