              "recommendation": "Run the pin check (Pins.checks, or the cheap doctor_quick) before executing the mediator for journal verification and refuse on drift, mirroring the up/run/session gate; alternatively verify the mediator pin inside `journal_verify/0` before the System.cmd.",
              "cwe_id": "CWE-863",
