                "Instance uses the default base (KOMKI_HOME unset) and nobody has manually hardened the file"
              ],
              "category": "Incorrect Default Permissions",
              "severity": "LOW",
              "confidence": "medium",
              "recommendation": "Mirror the codebase's own pattern (channel.ex:77-81, llama.ex:157-161): on first creation, touch the DB path exclusively, File.chmod!(db_path, 0o600) before/after Sqlite3.open, and consider 0700 for the base directory; do the same for the -wal/-shm companion files.",
              "cwe_id": "CWE-276",
